                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e0d9318-7688-32c2-a5ae-31ed010cd49b",
                        "entry_id": "4d656f04-c61f-3db2-8152-cf02ba5a3653",
                        "glosses": [
                            "搖頭丸的學名"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1193e06-189c-448f-b6f4-b31b60104a2a",
                                "sense_id": "6e0d9318-7688-32c2-a5ae-31ed010cd49b",
                                "text": "Unlike many of its subsequent users, Shulgin did not find his MDMA experience transformative. For him the effect was like a particularly lucid alcohol buzz; he called it his \"low-calorie martini.\"",
                                "translation": "与许多后来的使用者不同，舒尔金并没有觉得服用MDMA后发生了翻天覆地的变化。对他来说，这种效果就像是清醒状态下的酒精微醺；他称之为他的“低卡马丁尼”。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a709b021-fc59-4859-9ad0-5cee5fe727ab",
                                "sense_id": "6e0d9318-7688-32c2-a5ae-31ed010cd49b",
                                "text": "A bit of folk wisdom from early cohorts of MDMA users advised against getting married within six weeks of one's first MDMA experience.",
                                "translation": "早期MDMA使用者流传下来的一条民间智慧建议，在第一次服用MDMA后的六周内不要结婚。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e81d51b3-4d1e-476c-b764-daf547795869",
                                "sense_id": "6e0d9318-7688-32c2-a5ae-31ed010cd49b",
                                "text": "When MDMA was placed on Schedule 1, the worst category of illegal drugs, the yuppies stopped partying and the dance scene went underground.",
                                "translation": "当MDMA被列入一级管制药品（最严重的非法药物类别）时，雅皮士们停止了聚会，舞厅文化也转入了地下。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9beaf94f-5914-460f-af18-961e0ce02c0f",
                                "sense_id": "6e0d9318-7688-32c2-a5ae-31ed010cd49b",
                                "text": "In an important step toward medical approval, MDMA, the illegal drug popularly known as Ecstasy or Molly, was shown to bring relief to those suffering from severe post-traumatic stress disorder when paired with talk therapy.",
                                "translation": "在迈向医疗批准的重要一步中，MDMA（俗称“摇头丸”或“莫莉”）这种非法药物被证明与谈话疗法相结合，可以缓解患有严重创伤后应激障碍的人的症状。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
